# Registry for `secret seed` / `secret ls`: one "<name> <op://ref>" per line.
# Names are what configs read at runtime via `secret get <name>` (OS keychain,
# ~30ms, no TTY). Re-run `secret seed` after rotating anything in 1Password.
#
# homebrew-github-token       op://Private/homebrew/token
# davmail-password            op://Private/work-o365/password
# google-api-client-id        op://Private/google-api/client_id
# google-api-client-secret    op://Private/google-api/client_secret
# ntfy-topic                  op://Private/ntfy/topic
